- nameSync() in lib/fs.js

  js_mmap_filename() in quickjs-mmap.c has no WINDOWS implementation

  ../../c-utils/lib/stralloc/open_filename.c
  ../../c-utils/lib/stralloc/mmap_filename.c

   on a non-windows system we have these methods:
     - fcntl(fd, F_GETPATH, buf)
     - mmap() the file and read /proc/self/maps to find
       the mapped range will give the filename

   on windows we do:
      1. mmap() the file (via src/win32/mmap.c compat layer)
      2. use GetMappedFileNameW() from psapi.dll on the address;
         this gives a path with a device name, not drive letter
      3. use GetLogicalDriveStringsW() & QueryDosDevice() to 
         get the drive letter


